--- !u!114 &4555472659365738234
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: <b>The rendering path.</b> In the Renderer, the <i>Rendering Path</i> is <b>Forward+</b>. In Forward, each object is lit by a limited number of additional lights (<i>Per Object Limit</i>, at most 8). Forward+ has no limit per object, and this scene uses 26 lights.
--- !u!114 &4648938236697821805
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>The URP Asset</b> (<i>Settings/PC_RPAsset</i>): <b>HDR</b> on (bright values above 1 are kept, so bloom can find them), <b>Depth Texture</b> and <b>Opaque Texture</b> on (the fog and the reflections read them), <b>Additional Lights: Per Pixel</b> with <b>Cast Shadows</b> on. <b>Use Rendering Layers</b> on, in the Lighting section (the fog-only lights in \xA7 10 need it)."
